            "detailed_description": "<h1>Strategy guides and other resources available at </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><strong>Nancy Drew®: Secrets Can Kill REMASTERED</strong> is a first-person perspective, point-and-click adventure game.  The player is Nancy Drew and has to solve a mystery. Explore rich environments for clues, interrogate suspects, and solve puzzles and mini-games.<br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as Nancy Drew and investigate a murder at a local school.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>3D animated characters, each with a secret to protect.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>New puzzles and storyline twists await you in the high school halls.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Vintage Nancy Drew references celebrating the brand’s 80th anniversary.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Take risks without starting over – the game will automatically return the player to the point before the fatal mistake.  <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Choose from Junior or Senior Detective difficulty levels</li></ul>",
